<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" xmlns:content="http://purl.org/rss/1.0/modules/content/"><channel><title>页表 on Minghan的博客</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/%E9%A1%B5%E8%A1%A8/</link><description>Recent content in 页表 on Minghan的博客</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>en</language><lastBuildDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:01:51 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://Jiangmmh.github.io/tags/%E9%A1%B5%E8%A1%A8/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>MIT6.1810: Lab3 Pagetable</title><link>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab3-pgtbl/</link><pubDate>Tue, 27 Oct 2026 11:01:51 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://Jiangmmh.github.io/posts/xv6-lab3-pgtbl/</guid><description>&lt;h1 id="一inspect-a-user-process-page-tableeasy">一、&lt;strong>Inspect a user-process page table (easy)&lt;/strong>·&lt;/h1>
&lt;p>xv6提供了一个用户程序pgtbltest.c，其中调用print_pgtbl()打印了页表的前10个页面和后10页的页表项，因为页表属于内核管理的数据结构，所以想要获取页表项就必须通过系统调用才行。在该lab中xv6额外提供了几个系统调用，其中的pgpte()的作用就是根据虚拟地址va，得到其对应的PTE。&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">ugetpid&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">pgpte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">vmprint&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">pgaccess&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">base&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">len&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">mask&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">int&lt;/span> &lt;span class="nf">ksupernpte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">,&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-c" data-lang="c">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="kt">void&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="nf">print_pgtbl&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">()&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;print_pgtbl starting&lt;/span>&lt;span class="se">\n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">0&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">++&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">print_pte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">PGSIZE&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">top&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">MAXVA&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">/&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">PGSIZE&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="k">for&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">uint64&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">top&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">-&lt;/span> &lt;span class="mi">10&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">&amp;lt;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">top&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">;&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">++&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">)&lt;/span> &lt;span class="p">{&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">print_pte&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="n">i&lt;/span> &lt;span class="o">*&lt;/span> &lt;span class="n">PGSIZE&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl"> &lt;span class="nf">printf&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">(&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;print_pgtbl: OK&lt;/span>&lt;span class="se">\n&lt;/span>&lt;span class="s">&amp;#34;&lt;/span>&lt;span class="p">);&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">&lt;span class="p">}&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>启动xv6，运行程序pgtbltest打印页表：&lt;/p>
&lt;div class="highlight">&lt;pre tabindex="0" class="chroma">&lt;code class="language-bash" data-lang="bash">&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">xv6 kernel is booting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hart &lt;span class="m">1&lt;/span> starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">hart &lt;span class="m">2&lt;/span> starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">init: starting sh
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">$ pgtbltest
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">print_pgtbl starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x0 pte 0x21FC885B pa 0x87F22000 perm 0x5B
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x1000 pte 0x21FC7C17 pa 0x87F1F000 perm 0x17
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x2000 pte 0x21FC7807 pa 0x87F1E000 perm 0x7
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3000 pte 0x21FC74D7 pa 0x87F1D000 perm 0xD7
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x4000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x5000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x6000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x7000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x8000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x9000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF6000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF7000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF8000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFF9000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFA000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFB000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFC000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFD000 pte 0x0 pa 0x0 perm 0x0
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFE000 pte 0x21FD08C7 pa 0x87F42000 perm 0xC7
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">va 0x3FFFFFF000 pte 0x2000184B pa 0x80006000 perm 0x4B
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">print_pgtbl: OK
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vmprint_test starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">vmprint_test: &lt;span class="k">done&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pgaccess_test starting
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;span class="line">&lt;span class="cl">pgtbltest: pgaccess_test failed: incorrect access bits set, &lt;span class="nv">pid&lt;/span>&lt;span class="o">=&lt;/span>&lt;span class="m">3&lt;/span>
&lt;/span>&lt;/span>&lt;/code>&lt;/pre>&lt;/div>&lt;p>这个页表和用户进程的地址空间正好能对应上：&lt;/p></description></item></channel></rss>